# Workflow artifacts are PUBLISHED, not hidden. A project whose pitch is "a claim is
# worth what its receipt is worth" cannot keep its own tickets, plans, and reports
# local — CLAUDE.md requires them in the ticket's commit (DEC-007).
# What stays ignored is only what is generated or staged for submission:
.docs/scratch/
.docs/state/
.docs/drafts/
# Agent worktrees and local agent settings.
.claude/
node_modules/
dist/
# Astro build output.
.astro/
